      "statement": "An adviser relying on an IA-7104 determination must retain Rule 204-2(a)(8) records of its basis, including the dollar test used and determination date; the internal eligibility guide operationalizes this with pathway, evidence, decision-maker, and date fields and treats a missing recorded basis as no determination in audit.",
